  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting the Orangutans of Batang Ai National Park and Lanjak-Entimau Wildlife..Sanctuary</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will strengthen protection of Bornean orangutans in and around these protected areas through more effective law enforcement. The Recipient will do this by: (1) facilitating discussions between Malaysian and Indonesian enforcement agencies on establishing a joint enforcement unit to address cross-border incursions by non-Malaysians; (2) training protected area staff in ranger patrol techniques and providing required patrol equipment; (3) increasing the number of anti-poaching patrols (from 12 to 18 each year); and (4) increasing the quality of anti-poaching efforts through the inclusion of WCS Malaysia staff as third party auditors.</narrative>
  </description>
